OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F118A1788899632
OL,1,Vk4                              G11/20
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGLIVER TRANSPLANT
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGBABY DIES
OL,4,D
OL,5, Liam Hamer, the eight-month-old baby
OL,6, who underwent a pioneering liver
OL,7, transplant, has died five days after
OL,8, his operation at a Leeds hospital.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FLiam, who weighed just nine pounds,
OL,11,Fbecame the smallest baby in Europe to
OL,12,Freceive a transplant after surgeons cut
OL,13,Fan adult liver to a fifteenth of its
OL,14,Foriginal size.
OL,15,F
OL,16,FIt was thought to be the first time
OL,17,Fsuch a large liver had been used in
OL,18,Fsuch an operation anywhere in the world
OL,19,F
OL,20,FDoctors at St James's hospital said
OL,21,FLiam never recovered from the operation
OL,23,D]FFromG08-09-92F  teletextarchive.com
